          "text": "Trust is placed in people and relationships within networks rather than institutions by default, raising questions around accountability when trust is broken and requiring institutional public health to continually earn and maintain trust and credibility",
          "lensId": null,
          "flagged": false,
          "greyed": false,
          "sort": 0,
          "section": null,
          "sourceCardId": "1844635f-2bb4-432e-adfc-44f2836356de",
          "sourceLabel": "Session 1 - Scenario Assessment",
          "plausibility": 5,
          "impact": 5,
          "createdTime": "2026-09-25T13:47:07.604+00:00"
        },
        {
          "id": "837db701-0b69-4390-9426-9326eb274a50",
          "teamId": "ed470002-72b2-46ae-93b2-e02e757124d1",
          "authorPlayerId": null,
          "order": "FIRST",
          "parentId": null,
          "text": "The divide in this future, and the inequities that result (much like present times), is about who is connected to networks, who can navigate an increasingly noisy environment, and who has the capacity to quickly assess or verify often competing public health information",
          "lensId": null,
          "flagged": false,
          "greyed": false,
          "sort": 0,
          "section": null,
          "sourceCardId": "8060fe36-2da8-413c-add1-1f8f5d9976a0",
          "sourceLabel": "Session 1 - Scenario Assessment",
          "plausibility": null,
          "impact": null,
          "createdTime": "2026-09-25T13:47:07.605+00:00"
        },
        {
          "id": "84becb4b-b9a2-42df-81e2-7fba9a0e476b",
          "teamId": "ed470002-72b2-46ae-93b2-e02e757124d1",
          "authorPlayerId": null,
          "order": "FIRST",
          "parentId": null,
          "text": "Surveillance and disease detection are automated, but since information can come from many different networks and moves quickly alongside misinformation, power and influence comes from being able to verify and share information.",
          "lensId": null,
          "flagged": false,
          "greyed": false,
          "sort": 0,
          "section": null,
          "sourceCardId": "8ea8c04c-f8ca-4b71-9b12-f00d0ccc0a46",
          "sourceLabel": "Session 1 - Scenario Assessment",
          "plausibility": 5,
          "impact": 5,
          "createdTime": "2026-09-25T13:47:07.606+00:00"
        },
        {
          "id": "e6842698-b4d0-4451-9f2d-a541505ce2d4",
          "teamId": "ed470002-72b2-46ae-93b2-e02e757124d1",
          "authorPlayerId": "b3620032-5a7e-4dc4-be77-7a24a3fb348a",
          "order": "SECOND",
          "parentId": "356c3e9d-695b-442a-a07b-b923906b20b3",
          "text": "Governmental public health agencies have fewer staff",
          "lensId": null,
          "flagged": false,
          "greyed": false,
          "sort": 0,
          "section": null,
          "sourceCardId": null,
          "sourceLabel": null,
          "plausibility": null,
          "impact": null,
          "createdTime": "2026-09-25T14:49:17.413614+00:00"
        },
        {
          "id": "2dd16a85-eef9-4bb7-9587-099a8bb8dced",
          "teamId": "ed470002-72b2-46ae-93b2-e02e757124d1",
          "authorPlayerId": "b3620032-5a7e-4dc4-be77-7a24a3fb348a",
          "order": "TERMINAL",
          "parentId": "e6842698-b4d0-4451-9f2d-a541505ce2d4",
          "text": "Less formal public health training programs",
          "lensId": null,
          "flagged": false,
          "greyed": false,
          "sort": 0,
          "section": null,
          "sourceCardId": null,
          "sourceLabel": null,
          "plausibility": null,
          "impact": null,
          "createdTime": "2026-09-25T14:49:41.48429+00:00"
        },
        {
          "id": "d0a1ca4e-e037-4541-9d5a-4ba18362e43d",
          "teamId": "ed470002-72b2-46ae-93b2-e02e757124d1",
          "authorPlayerId": "b3620032-5a7e-4dc4-be77-7a24a3fb348a",
          "order": "ORDER_4",
          "parentId": "2dd16a85-eef9-4bb7-9587-099a8bb8dced",
          "text": "the public health workforce has less standardized approaches",
          "lensId": null,
          "flagged": false,
          "greyed": false,
          "sort": 0,
          "section": null,
          "sourceCardId": null,
          "sourceLabel": null,
          "plausibility": null,
          "impact": null,
          "createdTime": "2026-09-25T14:50:05.697038+00:00"
        },
        {
          "id": "1e53fa6b-dc07-4742-bf38-0b203d45b23a",
          "teamId": "ed470002-72b2-46ae-93b2-e02e757124d1",
          "authorPlayerId": "b3620032-5a7e-4dc4-be77-7a24a3fb348a",
          "order": "SECOND",
          "parentId": "61883f82-a31f-4085-9e2b-6142edb5eca5",
          "text": "There is greater attention and respect to learned and lived experience",
          "lensId": null,
          "flagged": false,
          "greyed": false,
          "sort": 0,
          "section": null,
          "sourceCardId": null,
          "sourceLabel": null,
          "plausibility": null,
          "impact": null,
          "createdTime": "2026-09-25T19:40:59.934778+00:00"
        },
        {
          "id": "3bf56c68-7fb8-4e9d-8b95-69c0d0c4ea7d",
          "teamId": "ed470002-72b2-46ae-93b2-e02e757124d1",
          "authorPlayerId": "23c09959-93ab-48cc-a1b6-4f115e4b92b5",
          "order": "TERMINAL",
          "parentId": "1e53fa6b-dc07-4742-bf38-0b203d45b23a",
          "text": "the rise of grifters pretending to have experience that they don't to monetize information sharing",
          "lensId": null,
          "flagged": false,
          "greyed": false,
          "sort": 0,
          "section": null,
          "sourceCardId": null,
          "sourceLabel": null,
          "plausibility": null,
          "impact": null,
          "createdTime": "2026-09-25T19:49:24.843231+00:00"
        },
        {
          "id": "4f13a87b-8e9c-4ba0-8bfb-399dbde91eb5",
          "teamId": "ed470002-72b2-46ae-93b2-e02e757124d1",
          "authorPlayerId": "23c09959-93ab-48cc-a1b6-4f115e4b92b5",
          "order": "ORDER_4",
          "parentId": "3bf56c68-7fb8-4e9d-8b95-69c0d0c4ea7d",
          "text": "People give money and resources to bad actors",
          "lensId": null,
          "flagged": false,
          "greyed": false,
          "sort": 0,
          "section": null,
          "sourceCardId": null,
          "sourceLabel": null,
          "plausibility": null,
          "impact": null,
          "createdTime": "2026-09-25T20:22:00.295775+00:00"
        },
        {
          "id": "63f32421-62ba-41af-84f7-eedc4c2c79cc",
          "teamId": "ed470002-72b2-46ae-93b2-e02e757124d1",
          "authorPlayerId": "23c09959-93ab-48cc-a1b6-4f115e4b92b5",
          "order": "ORDER_5",
          "parentId": "4f13a87b-8e9c-4ba0-8bfb-399dbde91eb5",
          "text": "Communities/people become more desperate for correct information and wealth/knowledge gaps widen",
          "lensId": null,
          "flagged": false,
          "greyed": false,
          "sort": 0,
          "section": null,
          "sourceCardId": null,
          "sourceLabel": null,
          "plausibility": null,
          "impact": null,
          "createdTime": "2026-09-25T20:22:50.86233+00:00"
        },
        {
          "id": "e9751371-cabf-444f-bcf8-dda8a111da4a",
          "teamId": "ed470002-72b2-46ae-93b2-e02e757124d1",
          "authorPlayerId": "23c09959-93ab-48cc-a1b6-4f115e4b92b5",
          "order": "ORDER_4",
          "parentId": "3bf56c68-7fb8-4e9d-8b95-69c0d0c4ea7d",
          "text": "Backlash of younger people against media platforms/leaders/grifters",
          "lensId": null,
          "flagged": false,
          "greyed": false,
          "sort": 0,
          "section": null,
          "sourceCardId": null,
          "sourceLabel": null,
          "plausibility": null,
          "impact": null,
          "createdTime": "2026-09-25T20:24:09.451701+00:00"
        },
        {
          "id": "b1c58bd9-7d70-41b9-bbc8-c461424a591a",
          "teamId": "ed470002-72b2-46ae-93b2-e02e757124d1",
          "authorPlayerId": "23c09959-93ab-48cc-a1b6-4f115e4b92b5",
          "order": "ORDER_5",
          "parentId": "e9751371-cabf-444f-bcf8-dda8a111da4a",
          "text": "Creates a population that is difficult to reach over certain mediums by reputable institutions",
          "lensId": null,
          "flagged": false,
          "greyed": false,
          "sort": 0,
          "section": null,
          "sourceCardId": null,
          "sourceLabel": null,
          "plausibility": null,
          "impact": null,
          "createdTime": "2026-09-25T20:27:04.281215+00:00"
        },
        {
          "id": "838f4698-b3cb-4f01-9201-35eb35748750",
          "teamId": "ed470002-72b2-46ae-93b2-e02e757124d1",
          "authorPlayerId": "23c09959-93ab-48cc-a1b6-4f115e4b92b5",
          "order": "SECOND",
          "parentId": "84becb4b-b9a2-42df-81e2-7fba9a0e476b",
          "text": "Surveillance is no longer a core public health function and considered as valuable",
          "lensId": null,
          "flagged": false,
          "greyed": false,
          "sort": 0,
          "section": null,
          "sourceCardId": null,
          "sourceLabel": null,
          "plausibility": null,
          "impact": null,
          "createdTime": "2026-09-25T20:32:13.351974+00:00"
        },
        {
          "id": "5c5e40cf-5bbf-44b2-8b5c-436828e8caa3",
          "teamId": "ed470002-72b2-46ae-93b2-e02e757124d1",
          "authorPlayerId": "23c09959-93ab-48cc-a1b6-4f115e4b92b5",
          "order": "SECOND",
          "parentId": "84becb4b-b9a2-42df-81e2-7fba9a0e476b",
          "text": "Because of the automation, disease detection and surveillance data is not shared",
          "lensId": null,
          "flagged": false,
          "greyed": false,
          "sort": 0,
          "section": null,
          "sourceCardId": null,
          "sourceLabel": null,
          "plausibility": null,
          "impact": null,
          "createdTime": "2026-09-25T20:32:51.024887+00:00"
        },
        {
          "id": "62cb48d5-259f-45fd-a0f7-ccdc4190ae7f",
          "teamId": "ed470002-72b2-46ae-93b2-e02e757124d1",
          "authorPlayerId": "23c09959-93ab-48cc-a1b6-4f115e4b92b5",
          "order": "SECOND",
          "parentId": "84becb4b-b9a2-42df-81e2-7fba9a0e476b",
          "text": "Larger populations drop out of using platforms that use automation",
          "lensId": null,
          "flagged": false,
          "greyed": false,
          "sort": 0,
          "section": null,
          "sourceCardId": null,
          "sourceLabel": null,
          "plausibility": null,
          "impact": null,
          "createdTime": "2026-09-25T20:33:34.17861+00:00"
        },
        {
          "id": "b8b86668-12c0-4fa1-a271-126cd9b7d667",
          "teamId": "ed470002-72b2-46ae-93b2-e02e757124d1",
          "authorPlayerId": "23c09959-93ab-48cc-a1b6-4f115e4b92b5",
          "order": "SECOND",
          "parentId": "84becb4b-b9a2-42df-81e2-7fba9a0e476b",
          "text": "Third sector is created to verify information",
          "lensId": null,
          "flagged": false,
          "greyed": false,
          "sort": 0,
          "section": null,
          "sourceCardId": null,
          "sourceLabel": null,
          "plausibility": null,
          "impact": null,
          "createdTime": "2026-09-25T20:35:47.587491+00:00"
        },
        {
          "id": "50429d98-0945-4a70-8f15-3e2aeae372ea",
          "teamId": "ed470002-72b2-46ae-93b2-e02e757124d1",
          "authorPlayerId": "23c09959-93ab-48cc-a1b6-4f115e4b92b5",
          "order": "TERMINAL",
          "parentId": "b8b86668-12c0-4fa1-a271-126cd9b7d667",
          "text": "Corporate (profit) and political incentives to control verification sectors",
          "lensId": null,
          "flagged": false,
          "greyed": false,
          "sort": 0,
          "section": null,
          "sourceCardId": null,
          "sourceLabel": null,
          "plausibility": null,
          "impact": null,
          "createdTime": "2026-09-25T20:36:32.255328+00:00"
        },
        {
          "id": "58815cdd-20a9-4171-abfd-02f3b1dc4aad",
          "teamId": "ed470002-72b2-46ae-93b2-e02e757124d1",
          "authorPlayerId": "23c09959-93ab-48cc-a1b6-4f115e4b92b5",
          "order": "ORDER_4",
          "parentId": "50429d98-0945-4a70-8f15-3e2aeae372ea",
          "text": "Individualized public health reporting based on personalized metrics and location (to monetize)",
          "lensId": null,
          "flagged": false,
          "greyed": false,
          "sort": 0,
          "section": null,
          "sourceCardId": null,
          "sourceLabel": null,
          "plausibility": null,
          "impact": null,
          "createdTime": "2026-09-25T20:42:17.311723+00:00"
        },
        {
          "id": "d3da915b-1666-4503-a2d6-fd72b74ba025",
          "teamId": "ed470002-72b2-46ae-93b2-e02e757124d1",
          "authorPlayerId": "23c09959-93ab-48cc-a1b6-4f115e4b92b5",
          "order": "ORDER_5",
          "parentId": "58815cdd-20a9-4171-abfd-02f3b1dc4aad",
          "text": "People are further connected to corporate products and individual data is owned by corps",
